*   Adequação para o modelo OO                                        |
*-----+--------+-------------------+------------------+---------------*

    DATA: lr_flag TYPE RANGE OF c.

    lr_flag = zcl_parametros=>get_param( iv_processo = c_hard_code_active_id iv_name = 'LOW' ).

    IF sy-subrc = 0 AND line_exists( lr_flag[ low = abap_true ] ).
      e_is_active = abap_true.
    ELSE.
      e_is_active = space.
    ENDIF.

  ENDMETHOD.
